          "settings": {
            "accordion_heading_1": "Materials and specs",
            "accordion_text_1": "<p>Our outer dog bed covers are made from a durable, GRS-certified recycled polyester knit that's soft to the touch but tough enough to earn our dig-proof claim. Our orthopedic inner mattress is a combination of polyurethane <br/>support foam, and a soft poly-fill for a bed that's supportive yet breathable.</p>",
