            "accordion_heading_2": "Shipping and returns",
            "accordion_text_2": "<p>Shipping over $100 is free to domestic locations. New items can be returned within 30 days for a full refund minus $10 restocking fee. </p>",
            "accordion_page_2": "",
            "accordion_heading_3": "Care Instructions",
            "accordion_text_3": "<p>Each outer cover is easy to clean and 100% machine washable. The <br/>discreet zipper also makes it easy to remove the cover. Please use cold water and tumble dry low, with zipper closed. Do not put the inner foam insert into the washing machine.</p>",
            "accordion_page_3": "",
            "accordion_heading_4": "Measurements & Dimensions",
            "accordion_text_4": "<p>SMALL: 24\" x 18\"x 3.5\": Under 25 lbs (Boston Terrier, Pomeranian, Pug)</p><p>MEDIUM: 36\" x 28\" x 4\": Under 60 lbs (Collie, Beagle, Cocker Spaniel)</p><p>LARGE: 44\" x 28\" x 4\": Under 95 lbs (German Shepherd, Lab, Golden Retriever)</p><p>EXTRA LARGE: 45\" x 35\" x 4\": Under 240 lbs (Great Dane, Akita, Newfoundland)</p>",
