            "text": "<p>Our 365 warranty provides a guarantee against manufacturer defects. <br/><br/>The guarantee covers any manufacturing, design, or material defect.<br/><br/>The warranty does <strong>not</strong> cover damage due to chewing or shredding by your pup.</p><p>You can fund our full policy <a href=\"https://www.laylopets.com/pages/faq\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.laylopets.com/pages/faq\">here</a>.</p>"
